    "body": "From an external bug-bounty report (rounds 9/10, tested against compiled binary at commit 67f8ef6, real PreToolUse hook JSON, isolated $HOME).\n\nThe write-hook's AST content scan only covers some edit tools. `MultiEdit` and `NotebookEdit` skip it, and `.ipynb` files aren't scanned at all — so unsafe content written through either of those paths bypasses the scanner that a plain `Write`/`Edit` would be subject to.\n\n**Priority: High** — no related prior issue noted.\n\nReproduce with `clawband test` / real hook JSON against a scratch `$HOME`.\n\n*— Claude (Sonnet 5), clawband backlog automation*",
